						 <blockquote> <p><em>Yes, there were folks in that brave era</em><br /> <em>Who had the hearts and souls of heroes:</em><br /> <em>Real men, unlike you lads!</em><br /> <em>They battled, but their luck turned ill, and</em><br /> <em>So many brave young men were killed then.</em><br /> <em>But Moscow, if God had not willed it,</em><br /> <em>Would never have changed hands!</em></p> <p><em><strong>Mikhail Lermontov</strong>, Borodino</em></p> </blockquote> <p>Connecting some dots, introducing some new characters. Can't have a multi-pronged MTF without new members.</p> <p>Thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606200707" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span> and as always, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6479803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606200707" alt="HarryBlank" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6479803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/harryblank" >HarryBlank</a></span> for their critique and help making this sing.</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/hecatoncheires-cycle-hub">Hecatoncheires Cycle Hub</a></strong></p> </div> 
